[PrintTextModified Text:不要～！我不放～！|#0103Bad02_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉紧紧抱住汉娜，<br>贴得更紧了。|#0103Bad02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呀，怎么这样抱过来……<br>喘不过气了！你抱太紧了！|#0103Bad02_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哇哇！请别晃得这么厉害。<br>好可怕啊～|#0103Bad02_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是我在晃……<br>是你太重了……|#0103Bad02_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜独自支撑着雪莉的手臂<br>正在微微颤抖。|#0103Bad02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想要返回，却发现不知不觉间<br>已经离艾玛和梅露露所在的地方很远了。|#0103Bad02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们就这样，找个合适的地方<br>降落吧！|#0103Bad02_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经……撑不住了……！|#0103Bad02_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？哇啊……！|#0103Bad02_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

; どすんと落ちる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_23 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，汉娜的魔法解除了，<br>两人掉进了下面的灌木丛中。|#0103Bad02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:16_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_19_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:幸运的是，由于飞行高度不高，<br>似乎没有受什么严重的伤。|#0103Bad02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉愉快的笑声在蓝天下回荡。|#0103Bad02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊哈哈！真有趣～！|#0103Bad02_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:觉得有趣的……呼、呼……<br>只有你一个人……呼、呼……|#0103Bad02_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜躺在地上急促地喘着气，<br>不满地瞪着雪莉。|#0103Bad02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，看来你一时半会站不起来呢～<br>我们在这里休息一会吧。|#0103Bad02_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你……可以先回去的！|#0103Bad02_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那怎么行呢～<br>毕竟是我提议要骑扫帚的呀。|#0103Bad02_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 寝転んでいる為非表示が好ましいが画面が寂しい為検討
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉躺在汉娜身边，<br>深深地吸了一口气。|#0103Bad02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈～……这里真是个舒服的地方呢。|#0103Bad02_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……确实不错呢。|#0103Bad02_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多亏了汉娜，<br>我们才能找到这么好的地方。|#0103Bad02_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我可不是……自己想来的……|#0103Bad02_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好啦好啦，别在意这些小事嘛！<br>毕竟现在心情这么好！|#0103Bad02_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……确实，感觉还不错呢。|#0103Bad02_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜享受着宁静的时光，<br>仿佛忘了身处监牢之中。|#0103Bad02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，雪莉突然像是想到了什么，<br>开口说道。|#0103Bad02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们就这样两个人<br>有多远跑多远怎么样？|#0103Bad02_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你在说什么呀？<br>那怎么行呢。|#0103Bad02_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么不行呢？|#0103Bad02_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么……就算逃跑，<br>很快就会被看守抓住的吧。|#0103Bad02_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就逃到它们抓不到的地方去啊。|#0103Bad02_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:逃到，抓不到的地方……|#0103Bad02_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:世界可是非～常广阔的。<br>说不定真的有那样的地方哦？|#0103Bad02_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到雪莉的话，汉娜睁大了眼睛。<br>眼中闪烁着惊讶和一丝期待。|#0103Bad02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是汉娜和我的话，也许真的可以。|#0103Bad02_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉轻轻地触碰了汉娜的手。|#0103Bad02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你真的，这么认为吗？|#0103Bad02_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:凡事都要试试看才知道嘛。|#0103Bad02_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对温柔微笑的雪莉，<br>汉娜的眼神更加动摇了。|#0103Bad02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定，其实有办法逃出这里，<br>只是大家都不知道而已。|#0103Bad02_Sherry017| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许我们甚至不用成为魔女。<br>……我想去寻找那样的未来。|#0103Bad02_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。|#0103Bad02_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜露出一个<br>仿佛随时都会哭出来的微笑。|#0103Bad02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只有你一个人的话我会担心的……<br>我也跟你一起去。|#0103Bad02_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好！<br>一起获得自由吧！|#0103Bad02_Sherry019| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不管那是多么渺茫的希望，<br>她们也无法不去追寻。|#0103Bad02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个环境已经将两人逼到了绝境，<br>让她们疲惫不堪。|#0103Bad02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，但是……那两个人……|#0103Bad02_Hanna015| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎明白汉娜指的是艾玛和梅露露，<br>雪莉露出了更加温柔的微笑。|#0103Bad02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:等我们获得自由，<br>找到安身之处后，就来接她们吧。|#0103Bad02_Sherry020| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不只是艾玛和梅露露，<br>还要接上所有幸存下来的人！|#0103Bad02_Sherry021| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，我们大家一起去野餐。|#0103Bad02_Sherry022| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每个人带上装满自己喜欢的食物的便当，<br>去温暖又阳光明媚的地方。|#0103Bad02_Sherry023| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……这主意真不错呢。|#0103Bad02_Hanna016| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那，走吧。<br>我们一起……|#0103Bad02_Hanna017| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜站了起来，牵起彼此的手，<br>相信梦想终会成真。|#0103Bad02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:此时，一滴泪水从汉娜的脸颊滑落，<br>被柔和的风带走了。|#0103Bad02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:过了一会——|#0103Bad02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

