@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉～！汉娜～！<br>你们在哪里啊～？|#0103Bad02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我们很担心你们。请回答一下～|#0103Bad02_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和梅露露来寻找<br>雪莉和汉娜。|#0103Bad02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:完全找不到她们……<br>如果我能飞的话，就不会这样了……|#0103Bad02_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是梅露露的错！|#0103Bad02_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定，她们从扫帚上下来后<br>躲在哪里了吧？|#0103Bad02_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你想啊，雪莉感觉就<br>很喜欢玩这种游戏。|#0103Bad02_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:躲起来……？|#0103Bad02_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:对啊，所以我们再多找找吧。|#0103Bad02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:好的！|#0103Bad02_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，无论她们怎么寻找，<br>都再也没有找到雪莉和汉娜——|#0103Bad02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从此以后，艾玛她们<br>再也没有见到过这两个人。|#0103Bad02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

